stem:
In the movie \textit{Speed} a bus has to leap a gap in an elevated freeway. If the bus had speed $v_0 = 100\ \mathrm{km/h}$ and the gap was $x = 15\ \mathrm{m}$,
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(a)] -- assuming the takeoff and landing points were at the same level, find the angle of projection of the bus's center of mass;
\item[(b)] -- if the bus took off horizontally, how much lower must the landing side have been than takeoff?
\end{enumerate}

